# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vercel Hobby / free-tier deploy limit workaround
# (same pattern as 2026-07-17 "force redeploy" when huge EXEs blocked push)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ship the static web app + small download assets only.
# Multi‑80MB Windows installers blow past hobby upload size; keep them on
# GitHub (repo / Releases) and link from the site instead of embedding every
# historical desktop/*.exe in the Vercel deployment.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Local build trees
node_modules
**/node_modules
android-app/build
android-app/.tmp-gradle-build
android-app/dist
desktop/dist
desktop/node_modules
desktop/app
scratch
codearc-restrosuite
codearc-restrosuite-1
backups
.git
test-results
uploads
gateway-hf

# Oversized binaries — DO NOT upload to Vercel hobby
downloads/**/*.exe
downloads/**/*.exe.blockmap
downloads/desktop/**
*.exe
*.blockmap

# Optional heavy APK can stay (~12MB). Uncomment if deploy still fails:
# downloads/*.apk
